      "finding": "Revenue is 100% dependent on a single unnamed crypto mining customer with approximately 2.5 years of contractual life remaining, creating acute concentration and cliff risk.",
      "evidence": "[Source: FMP /sec-filings 10-K 2025-07-30 Item 1] 'We currently serve one crypto mining customer with a remaining contractual term of two and a half years. This business segment accounts for all of the revenue we generated from our continuing operations for the fiscal year ended May 31, 2025.'"
